:: 4. Create Desktop Shortcut (.lnk) instead of batch file for completely silent launch
echo [GHOST_SETUP] Creating Desktop Launcher...
del /f /q "%USERPROFILE%\Desktop\SecureVault AI Antivirus.bat" >nul 2>&1
